Package: gstIndia
Title: Comprehensive India GST Data Repository (2017-2026)
Version: 2.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Pawan",
           email = "pawanjangra1198@gmail.com",
           role  = c("Data Analyst", "Research Consultant"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0000-0000-0000"))
Description: A comprehensive, analysis-ready repository of India's Goods and
    Services Tax (GST) ecosystem covering July 2017 through early 2026. Provides
    nine tidy datasets sourced from official Ministry of Finance and GST Council
    releases: state-wise monthly tax collection (CGST/SGST/IGST/CESS), state-wise
    refunds, GSTR-1 and GSTR-3B return filing compliance, e-Way Bill statistics,
    IGST settlement to states, monthly gross-and-net collection comparisons,
    state-wise taxpayer registration counts, and taxpayer constitution/gender
    analysis. Helper functions support filtering, year-on-year growth, rankings,
    compliance analysis, and e-Way Bill summaries.
